In detail, for training the network, we added randomly augmented, greyscaled video sequences from the Sintel dataset sampled to a regular hexagonal lattice of 721 columns to the voltage of the 8 photoreceptor cell types (Fig. 1f and equation (1)). We denote a sample from a minibatch of video sequences as \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
